  "description": "Powerful PDF library for working with PDF documents: print, silent print, create, edit, sign, convert to image files, display/view with dedicated component. This version is available only for Windows",
  "id": "PdfPrintingCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-03T13:26:42.623Z",
