  "projectUrl": "https://pdfprinting.net/",
  "published": "2026-11-03T13:15:56.527Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Features:\n- [PdfPrint] Faster printing with a much smaller spool file: pages go to the printer driver in a compact form. The printout is the same, with about three times less spool data for pages with much text, also when printing from PdfViewer. On by default; PdfPrint.CompactPrintOutput = false turns it off\n- [PdfPrint] New PdfPrint.PostScriptPassthrough (default false): with a PostScript printer driver, pages are sent as PostScript, with text as fonts, which gives about ten times less data for pages with much text. Printers with other drivers print as before\n\nBug Fixes:\n- [PdfPrint] Crash on Windows 7 since version 5.3.0.0",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
